{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The celestials took your daughter. To save her, you must become a monster\u2014without betraying your people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/d5bc6a48b9153336d4f53236c6e0729a.poster.avif?t=1759337842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/d5bc6a48b9153336d4f53236c6e0729a.webm?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/d5bc6a48b9153336d4f53236c6e0729a.mp4?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world torn apart by the discovery of the Forbidden Stone, four ancient celestial descend upon humanity, bringing ruin in their wake. Amid the chaos, a father's life is shattered when his daughter is taken\u2014vanishing into the divine unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not a tale of heroes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a story of desperation, duty... and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a noble lord\u2014tasked with protecting your dying kingdom\u2014now forced into a perilous quest through mythic lands to rescue your daughter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step forward blurs the line between savior and sinner, and every celestial you confront brings you closer to the truth... or total ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/cf4216ea7632c6effa15e90f04af7a3c.poster.avif?t=1759337842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/cf4216ea7632c6effa15e90f04af7a3c.webm?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/cf4216ea7632c6effa15e90f04af7a3c.mp4?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth meets hack-and-slash combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Eliminate enemies silently\u2014or slice through them in high-speed, anime-style action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character progression &amp; artifact upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Unlock abilities and develop your fighting style to suit your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving and exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  Discover lost civilizations, ancient runes, and forbidden knowledge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/0e5d1598750c8b2a38d08b8ad03ee754.poster.avif?t=1759337842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/0e5d1598750c8b2a38d08b8ad03ee754.webm?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/0e5d1598750c8b2a38d08b8ad03ee754.mp4?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven RPG experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong>Make impactful choices that affect your people, your daughter\u2019s fate, and your own soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric anime visuals &amp; dramatic cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  From shadowy forests to ruined temples, every region tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Excoverse</strong>, your journey is more than a rescue mission\u2014it is a reckoning.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the celestials true intentions and reunite your family\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become what you fear most? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039230?t=1759337842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039230?t=1759337842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/662f5b8ddbe715f0bea2890a7e318e8ed9b3eac3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759337842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/662f5b8ddbe715f0bea2890a7e318e8ed9b3eac3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759337842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features stylized anime and fantasy-themed combat. There is no depiction of blood, but visual effects such as light bursts emphasize combat scenes. The game includes sword fighting, an optional stealth mechanic, and some finishing moves that may contain content some players might find disturbing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The celestials took your daughter. To save her, you must become a monster\u2014without betraying your people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/d5bc6a48b9153336d4f53236c6e0729a.poster.avif?t=1759337842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/d5bc6a48b9153336d4f53236c6e0729a.webm?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/d5bc6a48b9153336d4f53236c6e0729a.mp4?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world torn apart by the discovery of the Forbidden Stone, four ancient celestial descend upon humanity, bringing ruin in their wake. Amid the chaos, a father's life is shattered when his daughter is taken\u2014vanishing into the divine unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not a tale of heroes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a story of desperation, duty... and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a noble lord\u2014tasked with protecting your dying kingdom\u2014now forced into a perilous quest through mythic lands to rescue your daughter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step forward blurs the line between savior and sinner, and every celestial you confront brings you closer to the truth... or total ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/cf4216ea7632c6effa15e90f04af7a3c.poster.avif?t=1759337842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/cf4216ea7632c6effa15e90f04af7a3c.webm?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/cf4216ea7632c6effa15e90f04af7a3c.mp4?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth meets hack-and-slash combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Eliminate enemies silently\u2014or slice through them in high-speed, anime-style action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character progression &amp; artifact upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Unlock abilities and develop your fighting style to suit your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving and exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  Discover lost civilizations, ancient runes, and forbidden knowledge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/0e5d1598750c8b2a38d08b8ad03ee754.poster.avif?t=1759337842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/0e5d1598750c8b2a38d08b8ad03ee754.webm?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/extras/0e5d1598750c8b2a38d08b8ad03ee754.mp4?t=1759337842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven RPG experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong>Make impactful choices that affect your people, your daughter\u2019s fate, and your own soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric anime visuals &amp; dramatic cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  From shadowy forests to ruined temples, every region tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Excoverse</strong>, your journey is more than a rescue mission\u2014it is a reckoning.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the celestials true intentions and reunite your family\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become what you fear most? </p>","developers":["ExContinium Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039230/92d451865337c6ed8449e5a3174de92d706e7e57/header.jpg?t=1759337842","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 ExContinium Games. All rights reserved. Excoverse and all associated logos and characters are trademarks of ExContinium Games. Unauthorized copying, distribution, or modification of this product is strictly prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3039230/833503115/d53bee6e2ee261e757542e7cf874efce903575be/1750960092/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749646791","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3039230/833503115/d53bee6e2ee261e757542e7cf874efce903575be/1750960092/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749646791","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3039230/833503115/d53bee6e2ee261e757542e7cf874efce903575be/1750960092/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749646791","id":257155486,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155486/movie480.mp4?t=1749646791","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155486/movie_max.mp4?t=1749646791"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155486/a56d783c3b5e8a5eefc6dbd710235e19c63b9fa9/movie_600x337.jpg